    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Add new file / folder inside mini.files is made hard by the autocomplete / suggestions. Is there a way to disable that or maybe a spelling check or at least have some suggestion that is relevant like:\r\n- suggest start to be same as parent <user>. \r\n- suggest middle as list of possibilities ['controller', 'service']\r\n- suggest file type ['ts', 'json', 'js', 'rs']\r\n\r\nI would appreciate a first step - disable suggestion on file name. \r\n\r\n![Screenshot 2025-02-07 at 09 10 36](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca715389-9332-4778-b204-7c89baf081c9)\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Add new file / folder inside mini.files is made hard by the autocomplete / suggestions. Is there a way to disable that or maybe a spelling check or at least have some suggestion that is relevant like:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>suggest start to be same as parent .</li>\n<li>suggest middle as list of possibilities ['controller', 'service']</li>\n<li>suggest file type ['ts', 'json', 'js', 'rs']</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I would appreciate a first step - disable suggestion on file name.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/3529836/410800612-ca715389-9332-4778-b204-7c89baf081c9.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..UjyVwkX9mfy7caI2Tk35-G3eIlwlyCkoTIEJjmTqYO0\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/3529836/410800612-ca715389-9332-4778-b204-7c89baf081c9.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..UjyVwkX9mfy7caI2Tk35-G3eIlwlyCkoTIEJjmTqYO0\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-07 at 09 10 36\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
    "bodyText": "Add new file / folder inside mini.files is made hard by the autocomplete / suggestions. Is there a way to disable that or maybe a spelling check or at least have some suggestion that is relevant like:\n\nsuggest start to be same as parent .\nsuggest middle as list of possibilities ['controller', 'service']\nsuggest file type ['ts', 'json', 'js', 'rs']\n\nI would appreciate a first step - disable suggestion on file name.",
