            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid, it is not really a 'mini.files' (or even 'mini.nvim' in this particular case) issue. Achieving this requires configuration/disabling of your autocompletion plugin (looks like 'blink.cmp') to be disabled in 'mini.files' buffers. To automatically do this, you can create autocommand for [`MiniFilesBufferCreate`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3049adbafd08b769d0700624fe9b85fa4176c88c/doc/mini-files.txt#L334) `User` event (similar to [this example](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3049adbafd08b769d0700624fe9b85fa4176c88c/doc/mini-files.txt#L464-L471)) or `FileType` autocommand for `'minifiles'` filetype.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I am afraid, it is not really a 'mini.files' (or even 'mini.nvim' in this particular case) issue. Achieving this requires configuration/disabling of your autocompletion plugin (looks like 'blink.cmp') to be disabled in 'mini.files' buffers. To automatically do this, you can create autocommand for <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3049adbafd08b769d0700624fe9b85fa4176c88c/doc/mini-files.txt#L334\"><code class=\"notranslate\">MiniFilesBufferCreate</code></a> <code class=\"notranslate\">User</code> event (similar to <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3049adbafd08b769d0700624fe9b85fa4176c88c/doc/mini-files.txt#L464-L471\">this example</a>) or <code class=\"notranslate\">FileType</code> autocommand for <code class=\"notranslate\">'minifiles'</code> filetype.</p>",
            "bodyText": "I am afraid, it is not really a 'mini.files' (or even 'mini.nvim' in this particular case) issue. Achieving this requires configuration/disabling of your autocompletion plugin (looks like 'blink.cmp') to be disabled in 'mini.files' buffers. To automatically do this, you can create autocommand for MiniFilesBufferCreate User event (similar to this example) or FileType autocommand for 'minifiles' filetype.",
